        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Mohenjo-daro</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 2500 BCE – c. 1700 BCE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">Built around 2500 BCE within the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/indus-valley-civilisation">Indus Valley Civilisation</a>; the founders are not known.</span></div>
